  - m_Id: 523231232
    m_Localized: Close-range cleave for clustered enemies. Steady recovery, but he
      must get close to deal damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 611311616
    m_Localized: Mid-range caster who fires dark orbs at the nearest target. Slower
      than an arrow, so moving enemies can evade it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 611311617
    m_Localized: Long-range archer who quickly shoots the nearest target in range.
      Strong reach, single-target damage; reposition when enemies close in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 611311618
    m_Localized: Barkheart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 611311619
    m_Localized: Recover 1 HP each second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 611311620
    m_Localized: Old-growth vitality restores 1 HP to Rowan each second. This passive
      is always active and has no upgrade levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
